{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"57817","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57817","key":"SV-11324","fields":{"summary":"Tech View: run edge to edge on white, no side gutter","description":"h3. What\n\nRemove the side gutter around Tech View's table.\n\nh3. Expected\n\nS2-R22: \"Tech View's table runs edge to edge on white, with no side gutter and no card or panel around it, as in the design.\"\n\nPRD: [Board View & Tech View PRD v51|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (S2-R22).\n\nh3. Actual (staging build, develop b19269d4487, clicked through locally)\n\nTech View's table sits inset from the page edges with a gutter on each side.\n\nh3. How to check\n\n* Tech View's table and its group headers run to both edges of the page, as in the attached design screenshot.\n* List is unchanged.\n\nh3. Screenshots\n\nAttached: staging build first, Branko's design (files starting D) after.\n\nRaised from Sasha's staging review, 2026-10-14.\n\n----\n\n*Test case for this design issue:*\n\n* [C590112|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590112] Tech View table runs edge to edge on white with no side gutter","comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57817/comment/78737","id":"78737","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=http